<p>In a mighty show of strength you whirl your grappled victim around and throw them into the air causing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">211%, 258%, 293%, 323%, 350%</acronym> damage to them and enemies in radius 1 on landing.  </p><p>If at least 1 other enemy is hit the thrown enemy will be shaken by the impact losing a full turn.</p><p>You can only throw enemies that could move normally.</p>